{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16318060","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16318060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1631806001:1":{"text":"설마... 유령이 되서 학생을 놀래키는 교장 선생님은 없겠죠?!","source_cn":"不会吧……哪儿有校长变成幽灵后吓唬学生的啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D508783954052DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631806002:1":{"text":"하지만 레이먼 교장 선생님이라면... 충분히 그러실 거 같은데...","source_cn":"但如果是雷蒙校长的话，好像不是不可能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F0B04E35C9522B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631806003:1":{"text":"그래. 레이먼이라면 유령이 되어서라도 여기저기 돌아다니면서 사람들을 놀래키겠지.","source_cn":"你说得对，如果是雷蒙那家伙，哪怕变成幽灵也会到处吓人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62BBBA655826684A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631806004:1":{"text":"하지만 너무 걱정하지 말거라. 네가 유령을 무서워한다는 걸 알면 레이먼은 너를 찾아오지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"不过你也不用太担心，雷蒙知道你害怕幽灵的话，就不会来找你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x666972A4D061998B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631806005:1":{"text":"게다가 누구나 유령이 될 수 있는 것도 아니고.","source_cn":"更何况，不是谁都能变成幽灵的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63D5C86127D54DA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631806006:1":{"text":"교수님은 레이먼 교장 선생님이 유령이 될 거라고 생각하세요?","source_cn":"老师，那你觉得雷蒙校长会变成幽灵么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB47C0E2A0B7CE8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1631806006":{"text":"교수님은 레이먼 교장 선생님이 유령이 될 거라고 생각하세요?","source_cn":"老师，那你觉得雷蒙校长会变成幽灵么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB47C0E2A0B7CE8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1631806007:1":{"text":"아카데미를 위해 평생 애썼으니, 이젠 푹 쉴 때도 됐지.","source_cn":"他为学校操劳了一辈子，更应该好好休息。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFEA240D0FAFFD662","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아카데미를 위해 평생 애썼으니, 이젠 푹 쉴 때도 됐지.","female":"아카데미를 위해 평생 애썼으니, 이젠 푹 쉴 때도 됐지.","variant_male_record_index":"221206","variant_female_record_index":"221207","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1631806008:1":{"text":"그래도 다시 한번 만나보고 싶구나...","source_cn":"但还是很想再见他一面啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F0B07F39C542E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"안 그랬으면 좋겠네","source_cn":"我希望他不会","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E993D10CFDF4AC2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"안 그랬으면 좋겠네","female":"안 그랬으면 좋겠네","variant_male_record_index":"87435","variant_female_record_index":"87436","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:迪伦":{"text":"딜론","source":"迪伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡里尔老师":{"text":"카리르 교수님","source":"卡里尔老师","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}